# Pin the renderer overlay guard to LF.
#
# WHY, measured 2026-09-30. checks/assert-no-renderer-overlay.mjs is a
# byte-for-byte copy of vivreal-site-renderer/docs/consumer-guard/, and the
# guard's own contract is that all three copies (renderer source, here, and
# Vivreal_Portal_Mobile) stay identical, verified with git hash-object.
#
# core.autocrlf=true is true on this machine, so without this line a FRESH
# CHECKOUT rewrites the file to CRLF and the byte-identical property breaks
# silently: the content is unchanged, every diff is empty, and only a hash
# comparison notices. That already happened once here, which is how an
# earlier copy stayed on the pre-fix version while reading as current.
#
# Vivreal_Portal_Mobile pins the same file the same way.
checks/assert-no-renderer-overlay.mjs text eol=lf
